# TURNIP TRUCK: THE BIG BEET. A giant beetroot charges at the truck when it
# can see it, faster than the truck for a moment; a touch costs a heart and
# it bounces off, gathers itself for about the truck's safety window and
# comes again, so a truck it corners is wrecked in about three seconds. Out
# of sight it rolls along the streets after you, slower than the truck; it
# never goes through a building.
seed 6
game turnip
wait 5
cheat day 3 2
cheat notraffic
expect beets == 1
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 264
cheat stop
cheat mob 0 520 264
wait 2
expect mob0_state == 1
waituntil hit_by3 >= 1 100
expect hearts == 2
expect mob0_state == 0
# behind the buildings: it rolls round by the streets
cheat clearmobs
cheat hearts 3
cheat inv 0
cheat mob 0 168 120
wait 5
expect mob0_state == 2
wait 30
expect mob0_solid == 0
wait 30
expect mob0_solid == 0
waituntil mob0_dist < 150 600
expect mob0_solid == 0
# a stopped truck it can see: three hearts gone in about three seconds
cheat day 3 2
cheat notraffic
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 264
cheat stop
cheat mob 0 470 264
waituntil tstate == 2 240
expect hit_by3 == 3
